0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 768.8899999999999864 Td
(Traditional college and university attendance workflows rely heavily on paper registers, manual roll calls, or RFID smart) Tj
T* (cards. These obsolete methods suffer from critical vulnerabilities: buddy punching \(students signing or swiping cards for) Tj
T* (absent peers\), long bottlenecks at entrance doors, physical wear-and-tear on fingerprint sensors, and tedious manual data) Tj
T* (entry at the end of each academic semester.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
10.9249999999999989 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
40. 708.8899999999999864 Td
(BioScan.AI delivers an enterprise-grade, contactless biometric solution designed to run natively within modern client) Tj
T* (browsers. It converts video camera streams into privacy-preserving 128-dimensional mathematical vector descriptors,) Tj
T* (performs sub-second Euclidean matching, suppresses background passersby through single-face foreground isolation, and) Tj
T* (provides automated reporting to Supabase PostgreSQL and Google Drive.) Tj
ET
